// Table 6-387: Sent CMD payload (PLC to RC) of "MoveApproachDirect"
// --------------------------
// Header
// --------------------------
// Byte 00 : UINT  - Type HB     
// Byte 01 :       - Type LB    
// Byte 02 : USINT - Reserve | ExecutionMode
